OL,3,AVillage referendum 'sent powerful
OL,4,Amessage' now government must listen
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal politicians have called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to take notice of a
OL,8,Freferendum held in the village of
OL,9,FBarnham and re-think its plans for
OL,10,Fhousing asylum seekers nearby.
OL,12,FNinety-four percent of those who took
OL,13,Fpart voted to become independent of the
OL,14,FUnited Kingdom as a way of protesting
OL,15,Fagainst a proposal to house migrants at
OL,16,Fthe former RAF Barnham military base.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
