OL,3,AVillage referendum 'sent powerful
OL,4,Amessage' now government must listen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police and crime commissioner for
OL,7,FSuffolk said the symbolic result "sends
OL,8,Fa powerful message" while the leader of
OL,9,FSuffolk County Council warned "society
OL,10,Fstarts to collapse when politicians
OL,11,Fstop listening".
OL,13,FThe Home Office says it recognises the
OL,14,Fstrength of feeling and insisted that
OL,15,Fit is listening carefully to the
OL,16,Fconcerns being raised.
